{"source": "NEJM DEFUSE-3 - Thrombectomy 6-16h (Table 2 page, journal 714)", "page": 7, "pageWidth": 567, "pageHeight": 756, "items": [{"text": "n engl j med", "rect": [220.23, 46.78, 262.82, 54.03], "fontSize": 7.25}, {"text": "378;8", "rect": [264.7, 46.78, 280.53, 54.03], "fontSize": 7.25}, {"text": "nejm.org", "rect": [287.93, 46.78, 319.15, 54.03], "fontSize": 7.25}, {"text": "February 22, 2018", "rect": [326.52, 46.78, 384.4, 54.03], "fontSize": 7.25}, {"text": "714", "rect": [30.99, 47.26, 45.4, 56.76], "fontSize": 9.5}, {"text": "T h e", "rect": [204.48, 723.09, 215.49, 730.09], "fontSize": 7.0}, {"text": "n e w e ng l a n d j o u r na l", "rect": [219.43, 722.68, 337.41, 731.68], "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "o f", "rect": [342.05, 723.09, 347.78, 730.09], "fontSize": 7.0}, {"text": "m e dic i n e", "rect": [351.74, 722.68, 399.92, 731.68], "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "Imaging Outcomes", "rect": [99.94, 212.37, 179.11, 221.37], "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "Imaging outcomes are summarized in Table", "rect": [99.94, 199.36, 286.69, 209.36], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "2.", "rect": [290.09, 199.36, 297.82, 209.36], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "The median growth of the volume of the infarct", "rect": [99.94, 187.35, 298.33, 197.35], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "region between baseline and 24 hours was 23 ml", "rect": [99.94, 175.34, 298.32, 185.34], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "in the endovascular-therapy group and 33 ml in", "rect": [99.94, 163.4, 298.3, 173.4], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "the medical-therapy group (P", "rect": [99.94, 151.39, 217.43, 161.39], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "=", "rect": [217.97, 151.39, 223.6, 161.39], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "0.08). Reperfusion", "rect": [224.36, 151.39, 297.99, 161.39], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "of more than 90% of the initial perfusion lesion", "rect": [99.94, 139.37, 298.27, 149.37], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "at 24 hours was more common in the endovas-", "rect": [99.94, 127.36, 298.31, 137.36], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "cular-therapy group than in the medical-therapy", "rect": [99.94, 115.43, 298.32, 125.43], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "group (79% vs. 18%, P<0.001). Similarly, the", "rect": [99.94, 103.42, 298.32, 113.42], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "percentage of patients with complete recanaliza-", "rect": [99.94, 91.41, 298.32, 101.41], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "tion of the primary arterial occlusive lesion at 24", "rect": [306.75, 211.37, 505.07, 221.37], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "hours on CTA or MRA was higher in the endo-", "rect": [306.75, 199.36, 505.11, 209.36], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "vascular-therapy group than in the medical-", "rect": [306.75, 187.35, 505.13, 197.35], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "therapy group (78% vs. 18%, P<0.001).", "rect": [306.75, 175.34, 466.47, 185.34], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "Subgroup Analyses", "rect": [306.75, 152.61, 387.33, 161.61], "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "The power to assess the response to therapy in", "rect": [306.75, 139.37, 505.1, 149.37], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "subgroups was limited owing to the lower-than-", "rect": [306.75, 127.36, 505.11, 137.36], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "anticipated number of patients enrolled as a re-", "rect": [306.75, 115.43, 505.1, 125.43], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "sult of early termination of the trial. There was", "rect": [306.75, 103.42, 505.1, 113.42], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "no heterogeneity of the treatment effect in any", "rect": [306.75, 91.41, 505.1, 101.41], "fontSize": 10.0}, {"text": "Outcome", "rect": [37.33, 659.69, 68.32, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Endovascular Therapy", "rect": [229.35, 668.68, 302.62, 676.68], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "(N", "rect": [251.27, 659.69, 259.8, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "=", "rect": [260.85, 659.69, 265.52, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "92)*", "rect": [266.24, 659.69, 280.7, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Medical Therapy", "rect": [316.43, 668.68, 371.51, 676.68], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "(N", "rect": [331.28, 659.69, 339.81, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "=", "rect": [340.8, 659.69, 345.47, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "90)", "rect": [346.24, 659.69, 356.7, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Odds Ratio or", "rect": [403.58, 668.68, 449.99, 676.68], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Risk Ratio (95% CI)\u2020", "rect": [392.25, 659.69, 461.33, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "P Value", "rect": [475.42, 659.69, 500.53, 667.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Primary efficacy outcome: median score on modified", "rect": [37.33, 644.35, 210.81, 652.35], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Rankin scale at 90 days (IQR)\u2021", "rect": [61.3, 635.36, 162.67, 643.36], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "3 (1\u20134)", "rect": [254.17, 644.35, 277.81, 652.35], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "4 (3\u20136)", "rect": [332.13, 644.35, 355.77, 652.35], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "2.77 (1.63\u20134.70)\u00a7", "rect": [398.42, 644.35, 455.25, 652.35], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "<0.001", "rect": [476.78, 644.35, 499.17, 652.35], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Secondary efficacy outcome: functional independence", "rect": [37.33, 621.55, 214.56, 629.55], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "at 90 days \u2014 no. (%)\u00b6", "rect": [61.3, 612.56, 136.12, 620.56], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "41 (45)", "rect": [254.17, 621.55, 277.81, 629.55], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "15 (17)", "rect": [332.18, 621.55, 355.81, 629.55], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "2.67 (1.60\u20134.48)", "rect": [397.97, 621.55, 451.63, 629.55], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "<0.001", "rect": [476.78, 621.55, 499.17, 629.55], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Safety outcomes \u2014 no. (%)", "rect": [37.33, 598.73, 128.7, 606.73], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Death at 90 days", "rect": [49.34, 584.9, 104.11, 592.9], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "13 (14)", "rect": [254.17, 584.9, 277.8, 592.9], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "23 (26)", "rect": [332.13, 584.9, 355.77, 592.9], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.55 (0.30\u20131.02)", "rect": [397.97, 584.9, 451.63, 592.9], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.05", "rect": [481.15, 584.9, 495.16, 592.9], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Symptomatic intracranial hemorrhage\u2016", "rect": [49.34, 571.08, 178.25, 579.08], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "6 (7)", "rect": [258.19, 571.08, 273.84, 579.08], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "4 (4)", "rect": [336.15, 571.08, 351.8, 579.08], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1.47 (0.40\u20136.55)", "rect": [398.02, 571.08, 451.68, 579.08], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.75", "rect": [481.15, 571.08, 495.16, 579.08], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Early neurologic deterioration", "rect": [49.34, 557.25, 146.88, 565.25], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "8 (9)", "rect": [258.19, 557.25, 273.84, 565.25], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "11 (12)", "rect": [332.18, 557.25, 355.8, 565.25], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.71 (0.30\u20131.69)", "rect": [398.02, 557.25, 451.68, 565.25], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.44", "rect": [481.15, 557.25, 495.16, 565.25], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Parenchymal hematoma type 2", "rect": [49.34, 543.43, 151.23, 551.43], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "8 (9)", "rect": [258.19, 543.43, 273.84, 551.43], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "3 (3)", "rect": [336.15, 543.43, 351.8, 551.43], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "2.61 (0.73\u201314.69)", "rect": [398.02, 543.43, 455.68, 551.43], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.21", "rect": [481.15, 543.43, 495.15, 551.43], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Imaging outcomes**", "rect": [37.33, 529.6, 107.55, 537.6], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Median infarct volume at 24 hr (IQR) \u2014 ml", "rect": [49.34, 515.78, 191.95, 523.78], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "35 (18\u201382)", "rect": [248.16, 515.78, 283.8, 523.78], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "41 (25\u2013106)", "rect": [324.19, 515.78, 363.82, 523.78], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u2014", "rect": [422.78, 515.78, 430.78, 523.78], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.19", "rect": [481.15, 515.78, 495.15, 523.78], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Median infarct growth at 24 hr (IQR) \u2014 ml", "rect": [49.34, 501.95, 190.48, 509.95], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "23 (10\u201375)", "rect": [248.16, 501.95, 283.8, 509.95], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "33 (18\u201375)", "rect": [326.18, 501.95, 361.82, 509.95], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u2014", "rect": [422.78, 501.95, 430.78, 509.95], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "0.08", "rect": [481.15, 501.95, 495.16, 509.95], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Reperfusion >90% at 24 hr \u2014 no./total no. (%)", "rect": [49.34, 488.13, 204.6, 496.13], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "59/75 (79)", "rect": [248.56, 488.13, 283.48, 496.13], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "12/67 (18)", "rect": [326.52, 488.13, 361.42, 496.13], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "4.39 (2.60\u20137.43)", "rect": [397.97, 488.13, 451.64, 496.13], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "<0.001", "rect": [476.78, 488.13, 499.17, 496.13], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Complete recanalization at 24 hr \u2014 no./total no. (%)", "rect": [49.34, 474.31, 223.93, 482.31], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "65/83 (78)", "rect": [248.56, 474.31, 283.48, 482.31], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "14/77 (18)", "rect": [326.52, 474.31, 361.42, 482.31], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "4.31 (2.65\u20137.01)", "rect": [398.02, 474.31, 451.68, 482.31], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "<0.001", "rect": [476.78, 474.31, 499.17, 482.31], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "TICI score of 2b or 3 \u2014 no./total no. (%)", "rect": [49.34, 460.48, 183.52, 468.48], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "69/91 (76)", "rect": [248.56, 460.48, 283.47, 468.48], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u2014", "rect": [340.0, 460.48, 348.0, 468.48], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u2014", "rect": [422.78, 460.48, 430.78, 468.48], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "*", "rect": [31.95, 440.68, 35.07, 448.68], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "An intervention was attempted in 90 patients (98%), of whom 88 had an attempted mechanical thrombectomy and 2 had carotid stenting", "rect": [42.94, 440.68, 501.82, 448.68], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "alone. In one of these two cases, the interventionalist elected not to perform a thrombectomy. The other patient did not have an occlu-", "rect": [43.97, 431.69, 493.07, 439.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "sion on the baseline angiogram but was treated with carotid stenting for presumed dissection. The 2 patients with no intervention had ca-", "rect": [43.97, 422.64, 503.78, 430.64], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "rotid-artery occlusions, one in the common carotid and the other in the internal carotid, and the interventionalist decided that treatment", "rect": [43.97, 413.64, 497.67, 421.64], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "was not feasible. Revascularization of the carotid artery with angioplasty, stenting, or both was performed in 13 patients (14%).", "rect": [43.97, 404.65, 467.64, 412.65], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u2020", "rect": [30.99, 395.66, 35.44, 403.66], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "The odds ratio is shown for the primary efficacy outcome, and risk ratio is shown for the other outcomes.", "rect": [42.94, 395.66, 393.81, 403.66], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u2021", "rect": [30.99, 386.67, 35.44, 394.67], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Scores on the modified Rankin scale range from 0 to 6, with higher scores indicating greater disability. The protocol required the score to", "rect": [42.94, 386.67, 499.55, 394.67], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "be assessed by a person who was not aware of the trial-group assignments. However, three patients in the endovascular-therapy group", "rect": [42.94, 377.68, 492.27, 385.68], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "and one patient in the medical-therapy group had an assessor who was aware of the trial-group assignments.", "rect": [42.94, 368.69, 406.81, 376.69], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u00a7", "rect": [30.99, 359.7, 35.44, 367.7], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Shown is the unadjusted common odds ratio. The odds ratio with adjustment for stratification factors is 3.36 (95% CI, 1.96 to 5.77;", "rect": [42.94, 359.7, 480.94, 367.7], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "P<0.001). The proportional-odds assumption was not met when core volume was included in the fully adjusted model; without core vol-", "rect": [42.94, 350.72, 496.02, 358.72], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "ume included, the adjusted odds ratio is 3.24 (95% CI, 1.89 to 5.55).", "rect": [42.94, 341.73, 271.44, 349.73], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u00b6", "rect": [30.99, 332.73, 35.28, 340.73], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Functional independence was defined as a score on the modified Rankin scale of 0 to 2.", "rect": [42.94, 332.73, 335.41, 340.73], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u2016", "rect": [30.99, 323.74, 34.3, 331.74], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Among the patients with symptomatic intracranial hemorrhage, the hemorrhage was rated as parenchymal hematoma type 2 (dense blood", "rect": [42.94, 323.74, 504.52, 331.74], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "clot exceeding 30% of the infarct volume with substantial space-occupying effect; in two patients in the endovascular-therapy group and", "rect": [42.94, 314.75, 495.08, 322.75], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "three patients in the medical-therapy group), parenchymal hematoma type 1 (blood clot not exceeding 30% of the infarcted area with", "rect": [42.94, 305.76, 485.77, 313.76], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "some mild space-occupying effect; in one patient in the endovascular-therapy group), hemorrhagic infarction type 2 (confluent petechiae", "rect": [42.94, 296.77, 497.64, 304.77], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "within the infarcted area, but without space-occupying effect; in three patients in the endovascular-therapy group), or hemorrhagic infarc-", "rect": [42.94, 287.78, 499.43, 295.78], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "tion type 1 (small petechiae along the margins of the infarct; in one patient in the medical-therapy group).", "rect": [42.94, 278.8, 396.05, 286.8], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "**", "rect": [30.99, 269.81, 38.99, 277.81], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Infarct volume at 24 hours was assessed on diffusion-weighted MRI (or CT if MRI was not feasible). Infarct volume and infarct growth at", "rect": [42.94, 269.81, 497.77, 277.81], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "24 hours were assessed in 90 patients in the endovascular-therapy group and 89 patients in the medical-therapy group (2 patients in the", "rect": [42.94, 260.82, 496.94, 268.82], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "endovascular-therapy group and 1 patient in the medical-therapy group died before imaging).", "rect": [42.94, 251.82, 353.6, 259.82], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Table 2. Clinical and Imaging Outcomes.", "rect": [37.73, 686.89, 171.42, 694.89], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "The New England Journal of Medicine", "rect": [220.0, 30.85, 344.35, 38.85], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Downloaded from nejm.org on May 17, 2023. For personal use only. No other uses without permission.", "rect": [116.2, 20.88, 447.99, 28.88], "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Copyright \u00a9 2018 Massachusetts Medical Society. All rights reserved.", "rect": [170.14, 10.91, 396.2, 18.91], "fontSize": 8.0}]}